/*
 * ExprClosure.h.ct - the closure grammar and argument checks (SH-94 S1a-1, pure move out of Expr.h.ct).
 *
 * The method bodies are byte-identical to the ones Expr.h.ct held; the
 * `Expr` type and every trait declaration live in ExprCore.h.ct, so this unit
 * imports Core instead of the host and the import graph stays acyclic.
 * Expr.h.ct imports this unit for the vtable.
 *
 * License: same as the rest of the compiler (see LICENSE / LICENSE.EXCEPTION).
 */

